sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS (cluster profile)
    participant Controller as Controller Manager<br/>kubeflow-trainer-controller-manager
    participant JobSetAPI as JobSet API
    participant Scheduler as Gang Scheduler<br/>(CoScheduling / Volcano)

    Note over Controller: Startup Sequence
    Controller->>K8sAPI: GET config.openshift.io/v1/APIServer<br/>Resolve cluster TLS profile
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: TLS profile (ciphers, min version)
    Controller->>Controller: Initialize OPA cert-controller<br/>Wait for certificate readiness
    Controller->>Controller: Register controllers + webhooks<br/>Ready probe gates on cert + webhook

    Note over User,Scheduler: TrainJob Creation Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply TrainJob<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-trainer-kubeflow-org-v1alpha1-trainjob<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook->>Webhook: Validate TrainJob spec
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created / rejected

    Note over Controller,Scheduler: Reconciliation Flow
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: TrainJob created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: GET TrainingRuntime / ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>Resolve runtime template
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Runtime template spec

    Controller->>Controller: Runtime plugin resolution<br/>(JobSet, MPI, CoScheduling, Volcano)

    alt Gang Scheduling (CoScheduling)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE scheduling.x-k8s.io/v1alpha1/PodGroup
    else Gang Scheduling (Volcano)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE scheduling.volcano.sh/v1beta1/PodGroup
    end

    Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE jobset.x-k8s.io/v1alpha2/JobSet<br/>With pod template from runtime

    alt MPI Training
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE ConfigMap (MPI host config)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE Secret (MPI SSH keys)
    end

    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Resources created

    Note over Controller,Scheduler: Status Update
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: JobSet status change
    Controller->>K8sAPI: PATCH TrainJob/status<br/>Update conditions and phase
